          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expiry reminders": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Houdbaarheidsherinneringen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expiry reminders and date scanning": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herinneringen voor houdbaarheid en datum scannen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First aid kit": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EHBO-doos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the instructions of the municipality and the emergency services; leave when you are told to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volg de instructies van de gemeente en de hulpdiensten op; vertrek als je dat gevraagd wordt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the news on your regional emergency broadcaster and on crisis.nl.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volg het nieuws via je regionale calamiteitenzender en op crisis.nl."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Food and water for your pets for the number of days you set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voer en water voor je huisdieren voor het aantal dagen dat je instelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Food that keeps without a fridge: one day of food per person per day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eten dat houdbaar is zonder koelkast: één dag eten per persoon per dag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For %lld people · %lld days": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor %lld personen · %lld dagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example the neighbours at number 12, or the community centre": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bijvoorbeeld de buren op nummer 12, of het buurthuis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example where it is stored": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bijvoorbeeld waar het ligt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fully charged; check the charge every six months.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volledig opgeladen; controleer de lading elk halfjaar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get a reminder 30 and 7 days before water, batteries or medicines expire, and at your half-yearly check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krijg een herinnering 30 en 7 dagen voordat water, batterijen of medicijnen verlopen, en bij je halfjaarlijkse checkmoment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get started": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aan de slag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to the agreed meeting point if you cannot reach each other.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ga naar het afgesproken verzamelpunt als je elkaar niet kunt bereiken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half-yearly check": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halfjaarlijks checkmoment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Has an expiry date": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heeft een houdbaarheidsdatum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gezondheid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides the item from your kit and shopping list, for example a pet food you do not need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbergt het item uit je pakket en boodschappenlijst, bijvoorbeeld dierenvoer als je geen huisdieren hebt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Household": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Huishouden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hygiene": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hygiëne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the power, water or internet fails, you need to manage on your own for the first three days. Noodpakket helps you build and maintain your emergency kit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als stroom, water of internet uitvalt, moet je je de eerste drie dagen zelf redden. Noodpakket helpt je je noodpakket samen te stellen en bij te houden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Important numbers": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belangrijke nummers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a life-threatening situation, go to a fire station, police station or hospital if 112 does not work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Werkt 112 niet bij levensgevaar, ga dan naar een brandweerkazerne, politiebureau of ziekenhuis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the kit": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In het pakket"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Information": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Informatie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item"
          }
        }
      }
